---
import Portfolio from '../layouts/Portfolio.astro';
---
<Portfolio page="experiments" route="experiments/" title="Experiments — Interactive tools by Shubham Shinde" description="Interactive tools, creative coding and visual experiments by Shubham Shinde, design lead and art director in Bengaluru, India.">
  <section class="page-intro"><h1>Experiments</h1><p>Small tools, visual ideas and things made out of curiosity. Built during breaks from the day job and whenever an idea refused to sit still.</p></section>
  <section class="experiments-list" aria-label="Interactive experiments and visual studies">
    <article class="experiment">
      <a class="experiment-art" href="experiments/dither-boil/" aria-label="Open Dither Boil"><video autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" poster="experiments/dither-boil/preview.jpg" aria-label="Animated dither effect on an archer illustration"><source src="experiments/dither-boil/preview.mp4" type="video/mp4" /></video></a>
      <div><p class="experiment-kicker">Creative coding · AI-assisted design</p><h2>Dither Boil</h2><p>Turn your image or clip into animated 1-bit grain. Tune the pattern and motion, then export a still or looping video.</p><div class="experiment-links"><a class="pill" href="experiments/dither-boil/">Open the tool ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="journal/dither-tool/">Read how I made it</a></div></div>
    </article>
    <article class="experiment">
      <a class="experiment-art" href="experiments/happy-diwali-3d/" aria-label="Open the Happy Diwali 3D greeting"><img src="experiments/happy-diwali-3d/assets/night.png" alt="Night scene from the interactive 3D Diwali greeting" loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080"></a>
      <div><p class="experiment-kicker">Interactive 3D · AI-generated models</p><h2>Happy Diwali, in 3D</h2><p>A browser greeting card with draggable Diwali objects, a day-to-night scene and a personalisable flip card.</p><div class="experiment-links"><a class="pill" href="experiments/happy-diwali-3d/">Open the greeting ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="journal/happy-diwali-3d-card/">Read how I made it</a></div></div>
    </article>
    <article class="experiment">
      <a class="experiment-art" href="journal/diwali-isometric-motion/" aria-label="Watch the Diwali isometric motion study"><img src="assets/journal/diwali/kandil-poster.jpg" alt="A Diwali diya, anar, chakri, kandil and kamal arranged on a dark isometric grid" loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080"></a>
      <div><p class="experiment-kicker">Motion design · AI-assisted making</p><h2>Diwali, mapped in light</h2><p>A 14-second isometric motion study built around five familiar Diwali forms and a little time off from the work calendar.</p><div class="experiment-links"><a class="pill" href="assets/journal/diwali/kandil-motion.mp4">Watch the film ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="journal/diwali-isometric-motion/">Read the story</a></div></div>
    </article>
  </section>
  <p class="journal-invite">More process notes and project stories live in the <a href="journal/">Journal ↗</a>.</p>
</Portfolio>
<style>
.experiments-list{padding:0 var(--pad) 56px;max-width:1560px;margin:auto;display:grid;gap:clamp(52px,8vw,112px)}.experiment{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.05fr) minmax(280px,.75fr);gap:clamp(24px,5vw,78px);align-items:center}.experiment:nth-child(even){grid-template-columns:minmax(280px,.75fr) minmax(0,1.05fr)}.experiment:nth-child(even) .experiment-art{order:2}.experiment-art{display:flex;aspect-ratio:16/9;overflow:hidden;background:#101112;color:#f4f4f5;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.experiment-art img,.experiment-art video{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.experiment h2{font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,64px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:0 0 18px}.experiment p{max-width:520px}.experiment-kicker{font-size:.74rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 16px}.experiment-links{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:18px;margin-top:28px}.experiment-links .text-link{color:inherit;text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:4px}.experiment:focus-within .experiment-art{outline:2px solid currentColor;outline-offset:4px}.journal-invite{padding:0 var(--pad) 100px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)}.journal-invite a{color:var(--ink)}
@media(max-width:760px){.experiment,.experiment:nth-child(even){grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:22px}.experiment:nth-child(even) .experiment-art{order:0}.experiment-links{margin-top:22px}}
</style>
<script>
const preview=document.querySelector('.experiment-art video');
if(preview instanceof HTMLVideoElement){const reduce=matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)');const sync=()=>{if(reduce.matches){preview.pause();preview.removeAttribute('autoplay')}else preview.play().catch(()=>{})};sync();reduce.addEventListener('change',sync)}
</script>
